    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Premium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Arrays</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Prefix sum + first index</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-size-subarray-sum-equals-k/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 325</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Maximum Size Subarray Sum Equals k</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The longest subarray ending at r with sum k starts right after the EARLIEST prefix equal to run - k, so store the first index of every prefix sum (seed 0 at -1) and never overwrite it. Negatives rule out a window; sums need 64 bits. O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
